WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
2024 test: AUROC 0.936, average precision 0.488, Brier score 0.021.

00:03.300 --> 00:06.300
Public rides, weather and AQI share hourly alignment,
labels and 12 model features.

00:07.100 --> 00:11.100
Historical models fit 2022–2023 and test 2024.
Browser parameters use a separate all-years refit.

00:11.900 --> 00:14.900
Five models compared on 8,204 test hours from 2024.

00:15.700 --> 00:17.700
ROC curves compare true-positive and false-positive rates.

00:18.500 --> 00:20.500
Precision–recall curves show performance on the low-demand label.

00:21.300 --> 00:24.300
Mean prediction: 6.88%. Observed rate: 2.46%.
Probabilities overestimate the event rate.

00:25.100 --> 00:27.100
Model scores include discrimination, probability error and calibration.

00:27.900 --> 00:31.400
Simulated recovery: 36.8% under full transfer;
18.4% at an assumed 50% transfer efficiency.
